  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間のwebインタビューが公開されてから\r\n多くなったよなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『おそろい買ったよ』とか\r\n『同じメーカーの使うようにしました』とか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こんなに……\r\n反応を頂けるものなんですね……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\n意外だったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、私物公開のお話を頂いた時は\r\n少し恥ずかしくて",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "変な中身じゃないかな、とか\r\nリュックの中を整理しなきゃ……とか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そういうことばかり考えてしまったんですけれど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ファンのみなさんは、同じものを探してくださったり、\r\nおそろいだよって教えてくださったり",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そういうことができるようになる企画だったんだ、って",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ぁ、すみません……っ\r\nいまさらですよね……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回真乃がそういう実感を得た、\r\nっていうことが大事だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンの人たちの熱量をさ、\r\n改めてぐっと感じたわけだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s3",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "とても……\r\nありがたいな、って思いました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それから──",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私も、灯織ちゃんとめぐるちゃんとおそろいにする時、\r\nいつもうれしくなるので……っ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今、ファンのみなさんも、\r\nそういう気持ちになってくださってるんだとしたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "とっても、いいなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな\r\n間違いなく嬉しくなってると思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "憧れの人と同じものが持てたら\r\n毎日に張り合いも出るし！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "パフォーマンスだけじゃなくて……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こういうことでも\r\nお返しはできるんですね……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101703/2001017030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nファンの人たちは、真乃のことが好きだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s3",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃の歌も好きだし、真乃のダンスも好きだし、\r\n真乃の色々な表情も見たいし──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃の好きなものだって知りたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001017030200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい",
